EXPERIMENT 6: CAKE ORDERING SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop an Online Cake Ordering System using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript that allows users to view cakes, select cake types, customize orders, calculate prices, enter delivery details, and confirm orders.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage for the online cake ordering system.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display different cakes with images, descriptions, and prices.
5. Allow users to select a cake, quantity, and cake size.
6. Calculate the total price based on the selected cake, size, and quantity.
7. Accept customer details and delivery information.
8. Validate the entered customer details.
9. Generate an order ID and display the order summary.
10. Stop the program.
